silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'GlueKleisliAnchorVetCarePlan77', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, VetCarePlan77 is a competing cocone target: a veterinary care plan object that also receives all ten typed legs through compatible arrows. Its existence is used to confirm that Mittens is the colimit: by JoC §11.3, there must be a unique mediating arrow u: Mittens -> VetCarePlan77. VetCarePlan77 is a valid apex but not the canonical one; Mittens is.." .
